<title>USA: Mellon Bank issues $300 mln 10-year notes.</title>
<headline>Mellon Bank issues $300 mln 10-year notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Mellon Bank Corp's Mellon Bank NA was priced on Tuesday, according to co-lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities was also co-lead manager.</p>
<p>BORROWER MELLON BANK NA</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.375 PCT  MATURITY 5/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SUB NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 11/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.375 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 70 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
